cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, its results or its figures, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Stress detection on WESAD: shortcuts, generalisation and physiological coupling graphs"
abstract: >-
  A leakage-safe, pre-specified analysis of acute-stress detection from wearable physiology on the
  open WESAD dataset, with cross-protocol-order evaluation, physiological coupling graphs inferred by
  a random-walk model, and a causal time-varying total-variation graph.
